Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["GHP weights of other NP Scalars", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.773034294153813*^9, 
  3.773034316970663*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"76659d35-ae65-46ec-8878-\
9c0fe395c853"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "It is easy to deduce the weights of the components of the Weyl scalars and \
Stress energy tensor components using the fact the weights of l, n m and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   OverscriptBox["m", "_"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b6206446-6009-47be-8eb1-619118aaf9b6"],
 " are {1,1}, {-1,-1}, {1,-1}, and {-1,1} respectively. These are their \
values."
}], "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8927135867739997`*^9, 3.8927136011258125`*^9}, {
  3.89271629166238*^9, 3.8927163000795074`*^9}, {3.8927163398061085`*^9, 
