\[CloseCurlyQuote] derivative operators while removing the \[Thorn] and \
\[Thorn]\[CloseCurlyQuote] derivative operators:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.892716691929706*^9, 3.8927167621697884`*^9}, 
